# Verification Gates (Conditional)

## When
- Any code behavior is changed.
- Tests, lint, types, configs, or build scripts are modified.

## Do
- Run relevant tests for touched behavior.
- Run lint/typecheck for touched modules when available.
- If checks cannot run locally, provide exact follow-up commands.

## Avoid
- Declaring completion without verification evidence.
- Running unrelated heavy checks when targeted checks are sufficient.

## Done when
- Verification commands and outcomes are recorded.
- No unresolved blocker remains for touched scope.
